      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PHASE N (Nov 2 First Unpark)\n\nNIM A Frozen Chores (N0\u2013N6):\n\u2022 N1: elsarticle pkg (no science)\n\u2022 N2: P1 funding (wait-on-human)\n\u2022 N3: 4 figures (CPU-only Mac audit)\n\u2022 N4: Honesty surfaces (ask user)\n\u2022 N5: Overleaf (halt if P1 open)\n\u2022 N6: Hard stop (no auto-advance)",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PHASE N (Nov 2 First Unpark)\n\nNIM A Frozen Chores (N0\u2013N6):\n\u2022 N1: elsarticle pkg (no science)\n\u2022 N2: P1 funding (wait-on-human)\n\u2022 N3: 4 figures (CPU-only Mac audit)\n\u2022 N4: Honesty surfaces (ask user)\n\u2022 N5: Overleaf (halt if P1 open)\n\u2022 N6: Hard stop (no auto-advance)",
