      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NAMED LATER (Not First!)\n\nOnly AFTER Phase N is done:\n\u2022 IMP \u4e2d\u671f\u8003\u6838 (wait for notice)\n\u2022 Zenodo 3473953 public sim test\n\u2022 ATTPC high-fid sim campaign\n\u2022 A-block audit (BLOCK rows)\n\u2022 Thesis chapters writing\n\n\u26d4 Never unpark into Phase N!",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NAMED LATER (Not First!)\n\nOnly AFTER Phase N is done:\n\u2022 IMP \u4e2d\u671f\u8003\u6838 (wait for notice)\n\u2022 Zenodo 3473953 public sim test\n\u2022 ATTPC high-fid sim campaign\n\u2022 A-block audit (BLOCK rows)\n\u2022 Thesis chapters writing\n\n\u26d4 Never unpark into Phase N!",
